   "t": "'They Aren't Playing Around': PlayStation Gamer Claims Account Was Banned After Sharing GTA 6 Leak, Faces 3-Month Appeal",
   "u": "https://www.ibtimes.co.uk/playstation-user-allegedly-locked-after-sharing-gta-6-leak-1829784",
